  "description": "CMS Open Source Repository Metrics Website",
  "longDescription": "The CMS Repository Metrics Website provides a comprehensive overview of software development activity across open source projects within a specified organization. This tool automatically collects GitHub repository data on a weekly basis to generate key numerical statistics and visualizations. It is designed specifically for developers and program managers who need to monitor the health and activity of CMS open source projects. By providing clear metrics and visualizations, the website enables users to quickly assess project status and make informed decisions regarding development priorities.",
